},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "Odeurpisse-Hyjal receives loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:247074::::::::80:104::6:10:12695:13524:12543:13361:13365:13435:13533:13557:10034:6005:1:28:2905:::::|h[Gravewarden Chestplate]|h|r.",
["id"] = "s0_134",
["timestamp"] = 1765113647,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Nutellone-Draenor",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Belac",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Belac yells: Sooner than expected, but no matter. Our work begins!",
["id"] = "s0_135",
["timestamp"] = 1765113649,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Nutellone-Draenor",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Image of Aegwynn",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Image of Aegwynn says: My protective wards now bar your way. Each seal can only be opened with one of the Pillars of Creation. Be warned: the demons will stop at nothing to prevent your advance.",
["id"] = "s0_136",
["timestamp"] = 1765113649,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Nutellone-Draenor",
["typeInfo"] = {
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY",
["type"] = "CURRENCY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive currency: |cnIQ6:|Hcurrency:3268:0|h[Infinite Power]|h|rx114062",
["id"] = "s0_137",
["timestamp"] = 1765113649,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Nutellone-Draenor",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Image of Aegwynn",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Image of Aegwynn says: I can sense one of the Legion's masters working to reanimate the Avatar of Sargeras. Should Kil'jaeden infuse that husk with the Dark Titan's power, I do not know whether any force on this world can stop it.",
["id"] = "s0_138",
["timestamp"] = 1765113666,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Nutellone-Draenor",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Mistress Sassz'ine",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Mistress Sassz'ine yells: These fools bring the Tidestone to us! Just as our blessed queen foresaw!",
["id"] = "s0_139",
["timestamp"] = 1765113670,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Nutellone-Draenor",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Illidan Stormrage",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Illidan Stormrage says: Few understood my use of the naga to obtain the Eye of Sargeras, but it was a necessary tactic to secure the future of Azeroth. Let nothing stop you from doing what needs to be done!",
["id"] = "s0_140",
["timestamp"] = 1765113670,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Nutellone-Draenor",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Mistress Sassz'ine",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Mistress Sassz'ine yells: Harjatan! Pummel their bones to dust!",
["id"] = "s0_141",
["timestamp"] = 1765113680,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Nutellone-Draenor",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Harjatan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Harjatan yells: Time to smash!",
["id"] = "s0_142",
["timestamp"] = 1765113682,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Nutellone-Draenor",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Archmage Khadgar",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Archmage Khadgar says: Then we have no time to lose.",
["id"] = "s0_143",
["timestamp"] = 1765113683,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Nutellone-Draenor",
["typeInfo"] = {
